# Launch Closure Rule

Apply this rule when working on checkout, auth, orders, delivery, finance, Supabase access, staging/prod, or launch readiness.

## P0 Must Not Regress

- Checkout identity cannot be spoofed.
- Loyalty/points cannot be spent for another user.
- Delivery geo/address data must be persisted.
- Merchant scoping must be server-side.
- Admin routes/actions must be guarded.
- Direct Supabase business bypasses must not be introduced.
- One merchant per cart/order must hold.
- Financial transitions must be auditable.

## Required Commands When Relevant

```bash
npm run build
npm run arch:guard
npm run test
cd backend && npm run build
cd backend && npm run test:policy
cd backend && npm run test:commercial
```

Document failures; do not hide them.
